son. This new rule is designed to enhance the effectiveness of dispute resolution and minimize delays. Both promoters and complainants are expected to be present to foster meaningful discussions and arrive at decisions. The conciliation cell strives to facilitate amicable resolutions between homebuyers and developers, ensuring that proceedings conclude promptly without unwarranted postponements.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/odisha-rera-mandates-buyer-promoter-presence-at-cdr-hearings/134203020?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-44458/134203020.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}]}